        220,
        155,
        253,
        903
      ],
      "margin_number": 3,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ff. γλυκύς and ἀμελής are used frequently. Learn these adjectives either now or at the end of this section (GE p. 215, #215). For γλυκύς cf. ‘glucose’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        256,
        156,
        297,
        878
      ],
      "margin_number": 11,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "πιθομένη Second aorist participle middle from πείθω, ‘having obeyed’, or ‘having been persuaded by’.\nτοιαύταις ‘by such women’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        300,
        156,
        326,
        888
      ],
      "margin_number": 13,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "παῦσαι The context will tell you whether this is aorist imperative middle or aorist infinitive active.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        329,
        156,
        365,
        878
      ],
      "margin_number": 15,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "βαδιῇ (What part of the verb is this?). Many -ιζω verbs have futures of this type. This one is middle, βαδιοῦμαι, as in the next line.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        368,
        156,
        381,
        781
      ],
      "margin_number": 19,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "κατακλίνῃ Notice also κλινίδιον ‘bed’. Cf. ‘recline’, ‘incline’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        384,
        155,
        399,
        617
      ],
      "margin_number": 20,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἐρῶ ‘I shall say’, ὡς here means ‘that’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        414,
        192,
        430,
        373
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Translation for 10D",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        435,
        191,
        452,
        790
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Myrrhine, coming down and reaching the gate, speaks to the baby.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        463,
        89,
        523,
        907
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYRRHINE",
      "text": "My child, how sweet you are. Come, I’ll kiss you. For your mother’s kiss is sweet. Your mother is sweet too; but you do not have a sweet father, but an uncaring one. I find fault with your father since he’s uncaring. Child, how unlucky you appear to be because of your father.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        526,
        89,
        558,
        910
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KINESIAS",
      "text": "But do you call your husband uncaring? For there’s no one more uncaring than you and no one more unlucky than me.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        561,
        191,
        577,
        617
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(Stretching out his hand to his wife, he speaks.)",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 14,
      "bbox": [
        580,
        191,
        616,
        869
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What is it that you want, you bad woman, that you do these things, obeying such women?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 15,
      "bbox": [
        619,
        89,
        630,
        756
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "Stop, you vilest of men, and don’t stretch out your hand to me.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 16,
      "bbox": [
        633,
        89,
        645,
        345
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KIN.",
      "text": "Won’t you come back home?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 17,
      "bbox": [
        648,
        89,
        674,
        886
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "By Zeus, I won’t go home. Before I do, the men must cease from the war and make a treaty. Will you do this?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 18,
      "bbox": [
        677,
        89,
        689,
        648
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KIN.",
      "text": "Why won’t you lie down with me for a short time?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 19,
      "bbox": [
        692,
        89,
        704,
        603
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "No. And yet I won’t say that I don’t love you.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 20,
      "bbox": [
        707,
        89,
        719,
        574
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KIN.",
      "text": "You love me? So why don’t you lie down?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 21,
      "bbox": [
        722,
        89,
        734,
        532
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "You silly fellow, in front of the baby?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 22,
      "bbox": [
        737,
        89,
        749,
        660
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KIN.",
      "text": "[You’re right] by Zeus. Manes, take the baby home.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 23,
      "bbox": [
        752,
        191,
        764,
        674
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The servant, who is carrying the baby, goes off home.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 24,
      "bbox": [
        767,
        191,
        780,
        712
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Look, the baby is out of the way, so won’t you lie down?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 25,
      "bbox": [
        783,
        89,
        795,
        781
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "But where should one do this? For first I must bring a little couch.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 26,
      "bbox": [
        798,
        89,
        810,
        750
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KIN.",
      "text": "Not at all, since it is possible for us to lie down on the ground.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 27,
      "bbox": [
        813,
        89,
        839,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "By Apollo, I shan’t allow you to lie down on the ground despite the state you’re in.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 28,
      "bbox": [
        842,
        191,
        855,
        326
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(She goes out.)",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 29,
      "bbox": [
        858,
        89,
        870,
        668
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "KIN.",
      "text": "Oh what good luck! It’s clear that my wife loves me.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    }
  ],
